    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d261-a5">

                <pb facs="0733" n="611" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg611"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 148.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Whitehouse to Mr.
                            Mariscal.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-10-21"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 21,
                        1889</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your excellency’s note of 8th
                    instant, concerning the punishment imposed on the officers concerned in the
                    regrettable affair at Eagle Pass, I am informed by my Government that Mr. Ryan
                    will, immediately on his return to his post from his leave of absence, be
                    instructed to join in a conference upon the subject of proper reparation to the
                    persons aggrieved by the facts complained of.</p>
                <p>I take, etc.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">H. Remsen
                    Whitehouse.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
